# PipeWire's libjack before jackd's: every JACK program on this machine -- the
# engine, the beat-analyzer, StemDeck, one started by hand -- talks to
# PipeWire. Debian's example (pipewire's doc/examples/ld.so.conf.d), shipped
# by a3-core-app under a name of its own, so a copy the admin made of the
# example stays theirs; 00- sorts it before the architecture's own directory.
/usr/lib/@MULTIARCH@/pipewire-0.3/jack/
